silm:instances_papers_18_presheaf_semantics_03_olog_node_arrow_law_concrete_anchor_4_f_arrow#mittensvetrecordpresheafanchornode4 silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensVetRecordPresheafAnchorNode4 is the schema-arrow f: A -> B, concretely the typed verb-arrow owns: Person -> DomesticCat in the Mittens vet-record olog. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'f_arrow', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
